id=\"CR39\">\n<span class=\"label\">39.</span><cite>Heruth DP, Gibson M, Grigoryev DN, Zhang LQ, Ye SQ. RNA-seq analysis of synovial fibroblasts brings new insights into rheumatoid arthritis. Cell Biosci. 2012;2:1–16. doi: 10.1186/2045-3701-2-43.</cite> [<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1186/2045-3701-2-43\" class=\"usa-link usa-link--external\" data-ga-action=\"click_feat_suppl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">DOI</a>] [<a href=\"/articles/PMC3560277/\" class=\"usa-link\">PMC free article</a>] [<a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/23259760/\" class=\"usa-link\">PubMed</a>] [<a href=\"https://scholar.google.com/scholar_lookup?journal=Cell%20Biosci.&amp;title=RNA-seq%20analysis%20of%20synovial%20fibroblasts%20brings%20new%20insights%20into%20rheumatoid%20arthritis&amp;author=DP%20Heruth&amp;author=M%20Gibson&amp;author=DN%20Grigoryev&amp;author=LQ%20Zhang&amp;author=SQ%20Ye&amp;volume=2&amp;publication_year=2012&amp;pages=1-16&amp;pmid=23259760&amp;doi=10.1186/2045-3701-2-43&amp;\" class=\"usa-link usa-link--external\" data-ga-action=\"click_feat_suppl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Google Scholar</a>]</li>\n<li id=\"CR40\">\n<span class=\"label\">40.</span><cite>Nota B, et al.  RNA sequencing of creatine transporter (SLC6A8) deficient fibroblasts reveals impairment of the extracellular matrix. Hum. Mutat. 2014;35:1128–1135. doi: 10.1002/humu.22609.</cite> [<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.1002/humu.22609\" class=\"usa-link usa-link--external\" data-ga-action=\"click_feat_suppl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">DOI</a>] [<a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/24962355/\" class=\"usa-link\">PubMed</a>] [<a href=\"https://scholar.google.com/scholar_lookup?journal=Hum.%20Mutat.&amp;title=RNA%20sequencing%20of%20creatine%20transporter%20(SLC6A8)%20deficient%20fibroblasts%20reveals%20impairment%20of%20the%20extracellular%20matrix&amp;author=B%20Nota&amp;volume=35&amp;publication_year=2014&amp;pages=1128-1135&amp;pmid=24962355&